151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (For me that showed up as: what if I get there and I'm just bored of myself? What if the silence tells me something I don't want to hear? What if people think it's sad that I'm doing this alone?)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (Here's what actually happened: the discomfort didn't last long, and it turned into something closer to relief. I stopped narrating my life for an audience and just started living it. Nobody around you is thinking "how sad, all alone" - the reality is they're thinking about their own lunch, their own trip, their own life. The story where everyone's watching and judging you is one your brain tells you at home and it very rarely survives contact with the actual trip.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
